        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_003",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Sorry, what was I saying, it's been going on for two months. I took the morning off to come in today. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't.",
